FastAPI will give each chunk of data to the `StreamingResponse` as is, it won't try to convert it to JSON or anything similar.

/// info

If you use `yield` **without** declaring `response_class=StreamingResponse`, FastAPI will instead treat it as a **JSON Lines** stream (see [Stream JSON Lines](../tutorial/stream-json-lines.md){.internal-link target=_blank}).

